<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>TimeRing — 시간을 보는 가장 단순한 방법</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #FAFAFA;
    --surface: #FFFFFF;
    --accent: #1E88E5;
    --track: #E6E6E6;
    --text-primary: #181818;
    --text-secondary: #6B6B6B;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 96px 0 64px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ring-wrap {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
  }

  .ring-wrap svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .ring-track {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--track);
    stroke-width: 14;
  }

  .ring-progress {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 14;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 528;
    transform-origin: center;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
    animation: countdown 4s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes countdown {
    0%   { stroke-dashoffset: 0; }
    92%  { stroke-dashoffset: 528; }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 528; }
  }

  h1.brand {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 2.6rem;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .tagline {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 36px;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.25);
  }

  .cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(30, 136, 229, 0.32);
  }

  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 56px 0 80px;
    border-top: 1px solid #ECECEC;
  }

  .feature h3 {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .feature p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .feature .dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #ECECEC;
    padding: 32px 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  footer a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 10px;
  }

  footer a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding: 64px 0 48px; }
    h1.brand { font-size: 2.1rem; }
    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; padding: 48px 0 64px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="wrap">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="ring-wrap">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200">
        <circle class="ring-track" cx="100" cy="100" r="84"></circle>
        <circle class="ring-progress" cx="100" cy="100" r="84"></circle>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <h1 class="brand">TimeRing</h1>
    <p class="tagline">시간을 보는 가장 단순한 방법</p>
    <a class="cta" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gogoand.timering" target="_blank">
      Google Play에서 다운로드
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <h3>돌리거나 입력해서</h3>
      <p>원형 다이얼을 돌리거나 숫자를 직접 입력해서 최대 60분까지 시간을 설정합니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <h3>내가 원하는 색으로</h3>
      <p>진행바 색상을 자유롭게 골라서 나만의 타이머로 꾸밀 수 있습니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="dot"></div>
      <h3>놓치지 않게</h3>
      <p>종료 5초 전 화면 점멸과 알람음으로 시간이 다 됐음을 확실히 알려줍니다.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <a href="https://gogoand.github.io/privacy-policy/timering.html">개인정보처리방침</a>
    <a href="mailto:greynull77@gmail.com">문의하기</a>
  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
